</ITEM>","number_of_corrections":5,"explanation":"1. Fixed a critical nesting error: The <BIBL> tag for 'Mohemii' was left open, causing all subsequent bibliography entries to be incorrectly nested inside it. 2. Corrected OCR/character encoding artifacts: replaced mathematical symbols (√) used as placeholders for umlauts (ü) and bibliographic format abbreviations (4to, 8vo). 3. Added an <INTRO> tag to separate the lead-in prose from the structured list of books. 4. Introduced <NOTE> tags to encapsulate bibliographic descriptions (e.g., 'Graece & Latine cum notis') to ensure structured data consistency. 5. Escaped the ampersand (&) to &amp; to comply with XML standards."}
